     "h": 334,
     "title": "Mobile »smartPallet system«",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Mobile »smartPallet system«</h3> <p>»smartPallet system«- for the provision of tools for automation systems. Thanks to the innovative pallet technology, tools can be reliably picked up and then transported manually or automatically to the various systems. </p> </figcaption>"
