     "h": 334,
     "title": "Precise setting and measuring device",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Precise setting and measuring device</h3> <p>Setting and measuring machine »venturion« - for the fully automated measurement of tools.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
