     "h": 334,
     "title": "Tested protective housing",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Tested protective housing</h3> <p>Protective housing - provides 360° all-round protection to safeguard your system in accordance with the latest standards and directives. The protective housing is part of the safety concept of the automation system, which is certified in accordance with the international standard IEC/EN 61010-1 and cNRTLus.</p> </figcaption>"
